{{also|nest|Nest|NEST|n'est}}
==Czech==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|nésti}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*nesti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-nést.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=impf|pf=donést|pf2=ponést}}

# to [[carry]]
#: {{ant|cs|nenést}}
#: {{uxi|cs|[[učitel|Učitel]] '''nese''' [[sešit|sešity]].|The teacher '''is carrying''' the exercise books.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|[[učitel|Učitel]] '''nese''' [[odpovědnost]] [[za]] [[bezpečnost]] [[žák|žáku]].|The teacher is responsible for the safety of the pupils.}}

====Usage notes====
'''Nést''' is in the class of Czech [[concrete verb]]s. Its counterpart, {{l|cs|nosit}}, is an [[abstract verb]].

